                                "sense_id": "a7efdb01-7489-3d07-887a-cc392dab474b",
                                "text": "\"There is clearly a systemic problem,\" said Richard L. Brodsky, a Westchester assemblyman, who is sponsoring a bill to require that mercury gauges be replaced with nonmercury alternatives."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f78155c3-9624-486c-bca1-1cab86f2fec9",
                                "sense_id": "a7efdb01-7489-3d07-887a-cc392dab474b",
                                "text": "Thomas P. DiNapoli, a Nassau County assemblyman also interested in the job, said he would voluntarily limit those contributions to $10,000, but said that eliminating them altogether would make it unduly hard for the nonwealthy to run for the office."
                            },
                            {
