                                "sense_id": "a7efdb01-7489-3d07-887a-cc392dab474b",
                                "text": "Having just elected to return the arms in question to their Catholic owners, Maryland's assemblymen were not about to authorize Nicholson's order to reconfiscate the arms and risk stirring up the anger of the colony's Catholics."
